factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 6 problems
  The article says the Kandasashti festival began on the 10th (no month given); the draft's reel_script adds 'அக்டோபர்' (October), which is not in the article.
  The slides_spec 'இன்று 15 நவம்பர்' gives today's date as 15 November, which is an invented date not stated in the article.
  The slides_spec and caption say the festival began on 'தேதி' 10 / '10 தேதி', but the article says it began on the 10th; the caption's 'கடந்த 10 தேதி' is a near-verbatim rendering and acceptable, but the slides_spec claim of a specific month/date for today is unsupported.
  The reel_script states the Murugan temple event happens at the Ammapettai temple at 4 PM as the 'சூரசம்ஹாரம்' location, and the slides_spec headline says 'அம்மாபேட்டையில் இன்று சூரசம்ஹாரம்' implying the main sooran vadham is at Ammapettai; the article says Sooraasamharam occurs at several temples (the Ammapettai description is the festival's own schedule, so this is consistent), but the 'Murugan temples' framing in the reel is fine.
  The reel_script omits the article's detail that Shanmugar rides on various vehicles daily with 'சத்ரு சம்ஹார திரிசதி' yagam; this is minor and not required.
  The reel_script omits the Pattaikoil 'வேல் மாறல்' parayanam and Athur Vadachennimalai thepathery event, which are reported past events, so omission is acceptable.
